The Hancom automation security module (FilePathCheckerModuleExample.dll) is NOT
bundled. If the user asks for it, Office Kit downloads it from Hancom's official
distribution (https://developer.hancom.com/hwpautomation) and it remains subject
to Hancom's terms.

